{"sha": "5b5db3fc0f0c21434dc1be18173d5580cbf8bdee5ef95074df0b4521902e599d", "body": ["\\section*{第 \\ref{ch:g10:reaction-progress-table} 章 --- 反应进度表}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g10:reaction-progress-table:1}", "\\ce{H2}：$4.0 - 2x$；\\ce{O2}：$3.0 - x$；\\ce{H2O}：$2x$。", "氢气在 $x = 2.0$ 时耗尽，氧气在 $x = 3.0$ 时耗尽，故 $x_{\\max} = \\qty{2.0}{mol}$，", "氢气为限量反应物。终态：\\qty{0}{mol} \\ce{H2}，", "\\qty{1.0}{mol} \\ce{O2}，\\qty{4.0}{mol} \\ce{H2O}。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g10:reaction-progress-table:2}", "碳将在 $x = 3.0$ 时耗尽，氧气将在 $x = 2.0$ 时耗尽：", "$x_{\\max} = \\qty{2.0}{mol}$，氧气为限量反应物。终态：", "剩余碳 \\qty{1.0}{mol}，氧气耗尽，二氧化碳 \\qty{2.0}{mol}。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g10:reaction-progress-table:3}", "$x_{\\max} = \\qty{0.30}{mol}$（硫为限量反应物）。终态：", "剩余铁 \\qty{0.20}{mol}，硫耗尽，生成硫化亚铁 \\qty{0.30}{mol}。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g10:reaction-progress-table:4}", "氮气在 $x = 1.0$ 时耗尽，氢气在 $x = 2.4/3 = 0.80$ 时耗尽：", "$x_{\\max} = \\qty{0.80}{mol}$。终态：\\qty{0.20}{mol} \\ce{N2}，", "无 \\ce{H2}，$2 \\times 0.80 = \\qty{1.6}{mol}$ \\ce{NH3}。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g10:reaction-progress-table:5}", "(b)：$4/2 = 2/1$。在 (a) 中一氧化碳为限量反应物，(c) 中亦然。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g10:reaction-progress-table:6}", "$n(\\ce{CH4}) = 32 / 16.0 = \\qty{2.0}{mol}$，故 $x_{\\max} = \\qty{2.0}{mol}$", "对于化学计量比混合物。氧气：$2 \\times 2.0 = \\qty{4.0}{mol}$，", "即 $4.0 \\times 32.0 = \\qty{128}{g}$。水：", "$\\qty{4.0}{mol} \\times \\qty{18.0}{g/mol} = \\qty{72}{g}$。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g10:reaction-progress-table:7}", "$n(\\ce{C3H8}) = 1000 / 44.0 = \\qty{22.7}{mol}$；", "二氧化碳 $3 \\times 22.7 = \\qty{68.2}{mol}$；$V = 68.2 \\times 24.1 =", "\\qty{1.64e3}{L}$，约 \\qty{1.6}{m^3}。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g10:reaction-progress-table:8}", "当 $x = \\qty{1.0}{mol}$ 时：\\qty{1.0}{mol} \\ce{CH4}，\\qty{1.0}{mol}", "\\ce{O2}，\\qty{1.0}{mol} \\ce{CO2}，\\qty{2.0}{mol} \\ce{H2O}。氧气", "在 $x = \\qty{1.5}{mol}$ 时耗尽，反应在此停止，故更大的", "反应进度永远不会达到。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g10:reaction-progress-table:9}", "$n_0(\\ce{Zn}) = 1.30 / 65.4 = \\qty{0.0199}{mol}$；", "$n_0(\\ce{Cu^{2+}}) = 0.10 \\times 0.1000 = \\qty{0.0100}{mol}$。铜离子", "为限量反应物：$x_{\\max} = \\qty{0.0100}{mol}$。生成的铜：", "$0.0100 \\times 63.5 = \\qty{0.635}{g}$；剩余的锌：", "$(0.0199 - 0.0100) \\times 65.4 = \\qty{0.65}{g}$。无铜离子剩余：", "蓝色已消失。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g10:reaction-progress-table:10}", "$n_0(\\ce{Mg}) = 0.48 / 24.3 = \\qty{0.0198}{mol}$，镁将在", "$x = 0.0198$ 时耗尽；$n_0(\\ce{H+}) = \\qty{0.020}{mol}$，氢离子将在", "$x = 0.010$ 时耗尽。酸为限量反应物：$x_{\\max} = \\qty{0.010}{mol}$，故", "生成氢气 \\qty{0.010}{mol}，$0.010 \\times 24.1 = \\qty{0.24}{L}$。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g10:reaction-progress-table:11}", "化学计量比混合物中含 \\qty{0.30}{mol} 硫，需要", "\\qty{0.30}{mol} 铁；铁多 \\qty{0.20}{mol}，即", "$0.20 / 0.30 \\approx \\qty{67}{\\percent}$ 过量。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g10:reaction-progress-table:12}", "物质的量相等：$m(\\ce{Fe})/55.8 = m(\\ce{S})/32.1$，其中", "$m(\\ce{Fe}) + m(\\ce{S}) = \\qty{10.0}{g}$。于是", "$m(\\ce{Fe}) = 10.0 \\times 55.8 / (55.8 + 32.1) = \\qty{6.35}{g}$，且", "$m(\\ce{S}) = \\qty{3.65}{g}$。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g10:reaction-progress-table:13}", "\\begin{enumerate}", "  \\item $n_0(\\ce{CaCO3}) = 10.0 / 100.1 = \\qty{0.0999}{mol}$，唯一的", "        反应物：$x_{\\max} = \\qty{0.0999}{mol}$；生成", "        \\qty{0.0999}{mol} 的 \\ce{CaO} 和 \\ce{CO2}，即", "        $0.0999 \\times 24.1 = \\qty{2.41}{L}$ 的二氧化碳。", "  \\item $n_0(\\ce{CaO}) = \\qty{0.0999}{mol}$，$n_0(\\ce{H2O}) = 1.8 / 18.0", "        = \\qty{0.100}{mol}$：生石灰（恰好）为限量反应物；", "        混合物接近化学计量比。\\ce{Ca(OH)2}：", "        $M = 40.1 + 2 \\times (16.0 + 1.0) = \\qty{74.1}{g/mol}$，质量", "        为 $0.0999 \\times 74.1 = \\qty{7.40}{g}$。", "\\end{enumerate}", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g10:reaction-progress-table:14}", "$n_0(\\ce{H+}) = \\qty{0.050}{mol}$（每只烧瓶中）；氢离子将在", "$x = \\qty{0.025}{mol}$ 时耗尽。镁：0.15、0.30、0.45、0.60、0.75、", "\\qty{0.90}{g} 分别得到 0.0062、0.0123、0.0185、0.0247、0.0309、", "\\qty{0.0370}{mol}。前四只烧瓶中镁为限量反应物，", "氢气体积为 $n(\\ce{Mg}) \\times 24.1$：0.15、0.30、0.45 和", "\\qty{0.60}{L}。后两只烧瓶中酸为限量反应物：$0.025 \\times 24.1", "= \\qty{0.60}{L}$。图像为过原点的直线，直至", "约 \\qty{0.61}{g} 镁，然后是在", "\\qty{0.60}{L} 处的水平平台。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g10:reaction-progress-table:15}", "$n_0(\\text{乙醇}) = 4.6 / 46.0 = \\qty{0.100}{mol}$（将在", "$x = 0.100$ 时耗尽）；$n_0(\\ce{O2}) = 4.8 / 24.1 = \\qty{0.199}{mol}$（将在", "$x = 0.199/3 = 0.0664$ 时耗尽）。氧气为限量反应物，", "$x_{\\max} = \\qty{0.0664}{mol}$。剩余乙醇：$0.100 - 0.0664 =", "\\qty{0.0336}{mol}$，即 $0.0336 \\times 46.0 = \\qty{1.5}{g}$。", "二氧化碳：$2 \\times 0.0664 = \\qty{0.133}{mol}$，即", "$0.133 \\times 24.1 = \\qty{3.2}{L}$。", "\\end{solution}", ""]}